notes.content:
Greetings!  haven't heard from me in a while, but know this! We haven't wasted any time. Take a look at the list of things we've managed to do in the meantime:
- Thought out the implementation of Solo mode;
- Added 2 new windows: "main screen" and "character screen" to the menu interface;
- Updated several Varusu animations;
- Realized the first passive skill for Varus;
- Organized and made more visually beautiful many objects in the game world;
- Drew and implemented several unique bridges that connect locations together;
- Finalized the Russian version of the Steam page;
- Updated the in-game store;
- Added new items to the equipment list.
- Finally, balancing equipment, affixes and new items that will add variety and strategic options to the gameplay.

